sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Trebuchet as Launcher
    participant HtmlUiParser as Parser
    participant EngineCore as Engine.Core
    participant HookRegistry as Hooks
    User->>Trebuchet: Launch App
    Trebuchet->>HtmlUiParser: Load Desired_layout.html
    HtmlUiParser->>HtmlUiParser: Parse Elements (buttons, dropdowns)
    HtmlUiParser->>HookRegistry: Register Hooks (e.g., id="Apply" -> Settings.Apply)
    Trebuchet->>EngineCore: Render UI via IRenderContext
    User->>Trebuchet: Click Button (e.g., Select Renderer)
    Trebuchet->>HookRegistry: Invoke Hook
    HookRegistry->>EngineCore: Execute (e.g., SetRenderer(Vulkan))
    EngineCore->>Trebuchet: Update UI/Renderer